{"answer_pre_raw":"{
  "answer_pre": "The primary challenge addressed by STST-JEPA in EEG analysis is dealing with the heterogeneity of EEG data due to cross-site montage differences, small labeled cohorts, and dominant subject-level non-stationarity.",
