{"answer_pre_raw":"```json
{
  "answer_pre": "DynaKRAG uses a unified state-of-the-art evidence acquisition framework that grounds evidence operations within a shared state and selects among currently executable operations as the state evolves. In contrast, Pitwall employs a directed acyclic graph (DAG) structure to isolate strategy effects in its Monte Carlo simulations.",
