  "answer_pre": "The common theme of 'security' or 'robustness' across Doc 2 and Doc 3 is the focus on enhancing security and robustness in federated learning frameworks. In Doc 2, security is achieved through the development of Collate, a collaborative neural network learning framework designed to handle latency-critical edge systems. In Doc 3, robustness is achieved through the introduction of Hallucination Self-Play (HSP), a framework that enables detectors to continuously learn and improve their ability to identify and mitigate hallucinations in large language models.",
  "evidence_pages": [2, 9]
}
