  "answer_pre": "In the runtime execution of AutoPersonas, the Large Language Model (LLM) is used as a schema-bounded semantic state machine that supports open-ended persona-life-environment evolution. In contrast, in the training preparation of SQuaD-SQL, the LLM is utilized for generating synthetic SQL queries from natural language questions, enabling fine-tuning through knowledge distillation and reasoning.",
