  "answer_pre": "Tidal effects in Paper 3 refer to orbital decay due to gravitational radiation and tidal interactions. Paper 2 omits tidal terms from its orbital decay formula because it focuses on GW emission as the primary driver of orbital decay in neutron star binaries.",
