{
  "answer_pre": "The EWMAD-DT detector distinguishes between point outliers and concept drifts by employing a dual-channel decision process: Channel I (Outlier Detection) isolates point outliers as warning or trigger points, while Channel II (Drift Detection) discerns abrupt, incremental, and reoccurring drifts. The EWMAD-DT detector leverages robust regression learners like HuberRegressor and TheilSen+ADWIN for outlier detection.",
