  "answer_pre": "The drift-sensitivity/threshold parameter in logistic regression models is often referred to as the threshold parameter in the context of concept drift detection, which is addressed by the EWMAD-DT (Exponentially Weighted Moving Absolute Deviation-DT) method in the first paper. In the second paper, the parameter is referred to as the smoothing parameter in the context of generalized multiquadric regression. The third paper does not explicitly mention a drift-sensitivity/threshold parameter.",
  "evidence_pages": [
    1,
    2
  ]
}
