{"answer_pre_raw":"{
  "answer_pre": "In the voltage regulation paper, the local Thevenin equivalent model breaks down under model mismatches, and the paper adds a Lipschitz-based Lipschitz constant estimation to recover safe behavior. In the MPC-RL paper, the LPV model breaks down due to disturbances and actuator dynamics, and the paper addresses this with a Lipschitz-based safety filter to ensure safety during deployment.",
