{"answer_pre_raw":"{
  "answer_pre": "HERON-SFL eliminates traditional backpropagation at federated learning clients by performing zeroth-order optimization on the client side, while quantum-enhanced parameter generation uses quantum gates to enable parameter updates without requiring classical backpropagation. This results in reduced client-side computational cost per training step.",
  "evidence_pages": [
    "Doc 1",
