{"answer_pre_raw":"{
  "answer_pre": "The first paper, 'Evaluating GAN-LSTM for Smart Meter Anomaly Detection in Power Systems', employs a centralized adversarial training framework for anomaly detection across a large-scale energy dataset from 406 buildings. The second paper, 'Distributed Reinforcement Learning Using Local Smart Meter Data for Voltage Regulation in Distribution Networks', uses a distributed RL algorithm with local training and coordination to avoid centralized aggregation of smart-meter data.",
