{"answer_pre_raw":"{
  "answer_pre": "The transformation invariance property applies to both the Linfoot informational correlation and Chatterjee's rank correlation when the transformation is continuous and injective. The Linfoot informational correlation is invariant to continuous and injective transformations of the marginals, while Chatterjee's rank correlation is an empirical realization of an underlying ε-δ structure that is preserved under continuous and injective transformations.",
