{"answer_pre_raw":"{
  "answer_pre": "The mmWave radar point cloud suffers from sparsity and variable-size point clouds, while the event-camera stream is asynchronous with continuous temporal changes. The proposed solution for the mmWave radar point cloud is to use a star graph structure with a manually added static center point and dynamic radar points connected to it, forming a directed star graph. For the event-camera stream, the proposed solution is to use event-based representations that capture changes in brightness over time.",
  "evidence_pages": [
    4,
